  "plain": "John F. Kennedy is said to have sat on the board of overseers for Harvard's astronomy department in the 1950s. The astronomer Beatriz Villarroel tells Michels this and credits notes kept by the UFO researcher Stanton Friedman. It matters to her because it would link a future president to the department at a time when, as others on the show tell it, UFO questions were being handled there."
